# doq: translated after an English change 2026-10-07
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Learn how a nuclear shell-model Hamiltonian, tabulated in a $J$-coupled basis of orbitals, becomes\n"
"a qubit Hamiltonian in the $m$-scheme, where one qubit is one single-particle state.\n"
msgstr ""
"Ketahui bagaimana Hamiltonian model petala nuklear, yang dijadualkan dalam asas orbital berganding-$J$, menjadi\n"
"Hamiltonian qubit dalam skema-$m$, di mana satu qubit ialah satu keadaan zarah tunggal.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-10-07
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Build a fixed, non-variational excitation ansatz whose angles come from second-order\n"
"perturbation theory, so there is no classical optimization loop.\n"
msgstr ""
"Bina ansatz pengujaan tetap yang bukan variasi, yang sudut-sudutnya datang daripada teori\n"
"gangguan peringkat kedua, jadi tiada gelung pengoptimuman klasik.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-10-07
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Compare qubit and fermionic excitations and measure how the choice affects the ensemble’s\n"
"two-qubit depth.\n"
msgstr ""
"Bandingkan pengujaan qubit dan pengujaan fermion, dan ukur bagaimana pilihan itu menjejaskan\n"
"kedalaman dua-qubit bagi ensembel.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-10-07
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Run self-consistent configuration recovery with `qiskit-addon-sqd` when the conserved\n"
"quantities are nucleon numbers, $M_J$, and parity rather than electron numbers and spin.\n"
msgstr ""
"Jalankan pemulihan konfigurasi konsisten-diri dengan `qiskit-addon-sqd` apabila kuantiti\n"
"yang terabadi ialah bilangan nukleon, $M_J$, dan kepariti dan bukannya bilangan elektron dan spin.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-10-07
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Apply one workflow from a 24-qubit problem you can check exactly to a 40-qubit problem\n"
"with nearly two million basis states, beyond this tutorial's exact-diagonalization capacity.\n"
msgstr ""
"Gunakan satu aliran kerja daripada masalah 24-qubit yang boleh anda semak dengan tepat kepada masalah 40-qubit\n"
"dengan hampir dua juta keadaan asas, melangkaui kapasiti pepenjuruan tepat tutorial ini.\n"

